Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.22,0:00:07.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,二百四十铜，够姐姐歇十二天。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.42,0:00:09.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,三个人！开门！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.54,0:00:18.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,省点力气。门不用开了。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.68,0:00:20.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,他们还活着。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.06,0:00:24.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,账上没有。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.68,0:00:27.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,这点钱买命？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.16,0:00:42.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,胜过真敌，直刺添一痕。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.06,0:00:55.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,阿砾！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.32,0:01:15.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,封舱！谁让出来的？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.38,0:01:19.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,活人我保。封舱损单，你签。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.26,0:01:22.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,他封的门。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.04,0:01:22.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,带去问话。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.54,0:01:27.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,二百四十。你的工钱。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.54,0:01:42.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,每人只算一次。痕永不消，能一直添。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.44,0:01:47.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,活人不用吃剩的。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.72,0:01:53.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,爹的青蟹号。三千铜。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.32,0:01:58.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,先不借。我们挣。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.96,0:02:03.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,六十铜。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.20,0:02:08.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,照子，跟我走。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.26,0:02:11.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,先放他。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.54,0:02:33.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,有人持刀！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.40,0:02:42.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,能刺，也得躲刀。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.10,0:02:46.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,下次先叫我关门。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.68,0:02:47.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,嗯。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.70,0:02:51.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,六百铜。桩过白线才付，我出两个人。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.12,0:02:54.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,两天工钱。帮我看水。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.76,0:02:57.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,喊了你听？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.78,0:02:58.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,听。
